<div class="modal fade"
     id="hint1"
     tabindex="-1"
     aria-labelledby="hintLabel"
     aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold"
            id="hintLabel">操作提示 (點開按鈕看說明)</h5>
        <button type="button"
                class="btn-close"
                data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                aria-label="關閉"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        {{>common-notes01}}
        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-success"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-sale"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-sale">
            銷售資料 (匯入ERP) ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-sale">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 請選擇 [日期範圍]，無輸入則只抓當天資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 請選擇 [銷售門市]，無輸入則抓取全部門市資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">3</span> 請選擇 [單據類型]，無輸入則抓取全部單據資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">4</span> 選擇完畢後，按下按鈕［下載］，即可下載ERP匯入檔案 </p>
            <hr>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-primary">金額欄位說明</span></p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">單價</span> 商品售出價格</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">加值</span> 會顯示加值名稱，如：保養廠、機車行</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">總折讓</span> 單品項總折讓 (包含 單品項折扣 與 整單折扣) </p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">小計(稅前價)</span> 單價 × 數量 + 總折讓</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-success"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-transfer"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-transfer">
            調撥出庫、供應商進退貨、總部進退貨 (匯入ERP) ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-transfer">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 請選擇 [日期範圍]，無輸入則只抓當天資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 請選擇 [出庫門市]，無輸入則抓取全部門市資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">3</span> 請選擇 [資料表]，無輸入則抓取全部單據資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">4</span> 選擇完畢後，按下按鈕［下載］，即可下載ERP匯入檔案
            </p>
            <p class="text-danger fs-5 fw-bold mb-1 mt-4">資料抓取規則說明：</p>
            <ol class="list-group list-group-flush list-group-numbered">
              <li class="list-group-item">只抓取「核准」資料</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">不抓取以下門市資料：總部(A)、測試店(TEST01)</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">為對應ERP調撥規則，需強制門市使用[匯入]功能進行調撥入庫</br>　若調入門市未使用[匯入]功能入庫，將不會抓取到檔案內
              </li>
              <li class="list-group-item">可透過 <span class="fs-6 badge bg-warning text-dark">調撥未抓取</span>
                按鈕，查看「調撥入庫」與「調撥出庫」沒有被抓取到的問題單據
              </li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-danger fs-5 fw-bold mt-4">功能 <span class="fs-6 badge bg-warning text-dark">調撥未抓取</span> 操作說明
            </p>
            <ol class="list-group list-group-flush list-group-numbered">
              <li class="list-group-item">請選擇 [日期範圍]，無輸入則只抓當天資料</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">請選擇 [出庫門市]，無輸入則抓取全部門市資料</li>
              <li class="list-group-item">選擇完畢後，按下按鈕［問題單據］，即可查看資料</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="fs-6 fw-bold mb-1 mt-2">未抓取說明：</p>
            <ol class="list-group list-group-flush">
              <li class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-secondary">0101</span> 調入門市不可為 A 或
                TEST01</li>
              <li class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-secondary">0102</span>
                匯入門市，未使用[匯入]功能進行調撥入庫</li>
              <li class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-secondary">0201</span> 調出門市不可為 A 或 TEST01
              </li>
              <li class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-secondary">0202</span> 未使用[匯入]功能進行調撥入庫
              </li>
              <li class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-secondary">9801</span> 單據不是「核准」狀態</li>
              <li class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-secondary">9901</span> 總部key單、不納入表內</li>
              <li class="list-group-item"><span class="badge bg-secondary">9902</span> 測試店key單、不納入表內
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-success"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-material"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-material">
            領用檔 (匯入ERP) ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-material">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">1</span> 請選擇 [日期範圍]，無輸入則只抓當天資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">2</span> 請選擇 [領用門市]，無輸入則抓取全部門市資料</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-secondary">3</span> 選擇完畢後，按下按鈕［下載］，即可下載ERP匯入檔案
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {{>common-notes02}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>